00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.520
and for engaging different communities

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.247
in conversations about
histories of racial violence,

00:04:30.247 --> 00:04:32.840
and how to connect
truthfully with the past.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:36.000
So I'm so thankful for the
invitation to come back.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.300
I'm also honored to
